  "decision_date": "05/04/2019",
  "description": "Erection of a two storey side extension and single storey side/rear extension with balconies to front and rear, provision for cycle and refuse storage and conversion of existing house into four self-contained flats",
  "site_name": null,
  "last_updated_by": "Northgate M3",
